WEBVTT

00:00:02.120 --> 00:00:05.460
Starting today, I'm charging
money for food Rihoko makes.

00:00:05.540 --> 00:00:07.380
Wha...
I'm sorry.

00:00:07.460 --> 00:00:12.260
Mariko-san said making breakfast
for free was hurting her business.

00:00:12.340 --> 00:00:14.050
That's harsh!

00:00:14.130 --> 00:00:15.880
Of course it is.

00:00:15.970 --> 00:00:18.430
Good morning! I'm off to work!

00:00:18.510 --> 00:00:20.760
Oh! Mom!

00:00:20.850 --> 00:00:23.020
Sheesh!

00:01:53.980 --> 00:01:54.690
She skipped breakfast again...

00:01:54.690 --> 00:01:56.070
"Thought"

00:01:56.070 --> 00:01:58.610
What was with that get-up? It doesn't suit her.

00:01:58.700 --> 00:02:01.820
Masamune-Chan said she's been
transferred to the Secretary Division,

00:02:01.910 --> 00:02:04.330
but she's been pretty "dry."

00:02:04.410 --> 00:02:07.330
Even after her last boss quit like that...

00:02:07.410 --> 00:02:11.630
My hunch must've been off.
I was sure she and that Takayama guy...

00:02:11.710 --> 00:02:13.790
...were going to get married?

00:02:13.880 --> 00:02:16.210
You know it's too sudden for that!

00:02:16.300 --> 00:02:20.180
But I really liked him when he
came over drunk that one time.

00:02:20.260 --> 00:02:23.930
Oh? Stern guys like him
are your type, Rihoko-Chan?

00:02:24.010 --> 00:02:26.010
Chou-san's a little shocked!

00:02:26.100 --> 00:02:29.390
No, but I like him. He seems nice!

00:02:29.480 --> 00:02:31.310
Eh? Nice?

00:02:31.400 --> 00:02:35.940
Yeah. Even Mom would talk about
Takayama-san a lot before bed.

00:02:36.030 --> 00:02:38.990
About how he's cheap, gloomy,
and that he's going to go bald...

00:02:39.070 --> 00:02:41.280
Are you sure those aren't insults?

00:02:41.360 --> 00:02:44.280
But now she doesn't talk about him at all.

00:02:44.370 --> 00:02:50.370
She doesn't seem worried
about him one bit! It's strange!

00:02:52.880 --> 00:02:54.420
Isn't it a nice view?

00:02:54.500 --> 00:02:55.880
Takayama-san would often stand there

00:02:55.960 --> 00:02:59.970
Segawa-kun, hearing that name first
thing in the morning is unpleasant.

00:03:00.050 --> 00:03:01.760
My apologies.

00:03:01.840 --> 00:03:06.050
Anyway, at 1 0:00 am,
you're scheduled to officially notify

00:03:06.140 --> 00:03:09.600
the Bio and Special Section
personnel of the sections' merger.

00:03:09.680 --> 00:03:13.350
Though it's more like the Bio
Section is "absorbing" than merging.

00:03:13.440 --> 00:03:15.980
It can't be helped.
That's the company's policy.

00:03:16.070 --> 00:03:21.450
Still, the speed at which you've
switched sides is almost artistic.

00:03:21.530 --> 00:03:23.780
After devoting yourself so much to Takayama...

00:03:23.870 --> 00:03:28.740
My job has always been to be
secretary to Douji Industries' directors.

00:03:28.830 --> 00:03:29.870
I haven't "switched sides" at all.

00:03:29.950 --> 00:03:36.210
I see. My own secretary
resigned on me, so this is perfect.

00:03:36.290 --> 00:03:39.460
Yagi-san quit so suddenly.
What do you suppose happened?

00:03:39.550 --> 00:03:41.420
Who knows?

00:03:41.510 --> 00:03:43.630
Good morning!

00:03:43.720 --> 00:03:45.140
You're three minutes late.

00:03:45.220 --> 00:03:47.180
Sorry!
Amaha-kun.

00:03:47.260 --> 00:03:52.850
Unlike Takayama, I'm not going to
pay you unless you work properly.

00:03:52.940 --> 00:03:53.770
I'm sorry!

00:03:53.850 --> 00:03:56.560
Well, your attire is somewhat passable,

00:03:56.650 --> 00:03:59.230
but that won't do for tomorrow's party.

00:03:59.320 --> 00:04:00.690
Party?

00:04:00.780 --> 00:04:03.900
A birthday party for a teacher I'm indebted to.

00:04:03.990 --> 00:04:05.990
You'll be joining me.

00:04:06.070 --> 00:04:07.950
A... party?

00:04:08.030 --> 00:04:10.790
What's wrong? You can't go with me?

00:04:10.870 --> 00:04:13.830
No, uhh... Understood.

00:04:13.920 --> 00:04:15.620
Shall I take care of her clothing selection?

00:04:15.710 --> 00:04:17.960
Yes, I leave it to you.

00:04:22.300 --> 00:04:25.630
I did it! What do you
think of that, Takayama?!

00:04:25.720 --> 00:04:28.470
The Witchblade, the woman, the secretary!

00:04:28.550 --> 00:04:31.600
They're all mine!

00:04:53.080 --> 00:04:54.750
All finished.

00:04:54.830 --> 00:04:58.670
I'll combine it with Maria's genes
right away to create a new Sister.

00:05:00.800 --> 00:05:03.760
This may be the last time.

00:05:03.840 --> 00:05:07.380
This next Sister will be the perfect one...

00:05:07.470 --> 00:05:12.060
Yes... I'm sure she will be.

00:05:12.140 --> 00:05:16.690
Aoi, do you know what
Grandfather wishes for?

00:05:16.770 --> 00:05:21.190
Umm... To create the
perfect human being, right?

00:05:21.270 --> 00:05:24.530
That is what all of NSWF is striving for.

00:05:24.610 --> 00:05:27.820
Grandfather has a different
reason for creating us Sisters.

00:05:27.910 --> 00:05:28.700
Different?

00:05:28.780 --> 00:05:33.490
Sister-related research is top priority
for all Japanese NSWF branches.

00:05:33.580 --> 00:05:34.450
Yes...

00:05:34.540 --> 00:05:39.620
And it's all to create the
mother that Grandfather seeks.

00:05:39.710 --> 00:05:43.090
Mother? Do you mean...

00:05:43.170 --> 00:05:48.720
He's just like I was,
when I was searching for my mom...

00:05:48.800 --> 00:05:51.350
Mother...

00:05:51.430 --> 00:05:53.930
What a shamefully dull man...

00:05:54.020 --> 00:05:58.140
Maria-sama! You mustn't
talk about Father that way!

00:05:58.230 --> 00:06:00.600
It's the truth.

00:06:01.940 --> 00:06:05.730
But Grandfather has power.

00:06:05.820 --> 00:06:08.700
The power to obtain what he wants.

00:06:08.780 --> 00:06:15.040
But, umm, you said we have
power too, as chosen ones...

00:06:16.870 --> 00:06:19.210
There are many types of power.

00:06:23.290 --> 00:06:27.760
Yo! Is the big corporate
secretary on her way home?

00:06:27.840 --> 00:06:29.220
C'mon...

00:06:29.300 --> 00:06:30.930
Hey, don't ignore me.

00:06:31.010 --> 00:06:32.050
What do you want?

00:06:32.140 --> 00:06:34.930
I came to pick you up. Get in.

00:06:38.640 --> 00:06:41.810
Why're you still working at Douji?

00:06:41.900 --> 00:06:44.770
Things're getting ugly there. Quit already.

00:06:44.860 --> 00:06:46.980
I don't appreciate you telling me what to do.

00:06:47.070 --> 00:06:50.280
Hey, now. I got the dirt on those I-Weapons.

00:06:50.360 --> 00:06:52.610
The X-Cons caused plenty of trouble as it is;

00:06:52.700 --> 00:06:56.620
if word got out they're turning
people into weapons, it'd be all over!

00:06:56.700 --> 00:06:58.790
So I'll be fine until then.

00:06:58.870 --> 00:07:01.750
The pay is good. I'm not quitting.

00:07:01.830 --> 00:07:03.170
Is it for Rihoko?

00:07:03.250 --> 00:07:07.250
Yes. I want to do things how I want!

00:07:11.180 --> 00:07:14.970
Y'know, you've been kind of
ruffled these past few days.

00:07:17.220 --> 00:07:19.680
I'm home!

00:07:19.770 --> 00:07:22.390
I'm starving!

00:07:22.480 --> 00:07:23.850
Welcome back!

00:07:23.940 --> 00:07:25.860
Good to see you again!
Kyoko-san!

00:07:25.940 --> 00:07:29.480
Surprised, aren't you, Mom?!
Umm...

00:07:29.570 --> 00:07:32.900
I'm doing a news story. I was in
the neighborhood, so I dropped by.

00:07:32.990 --> 00:07:37.450
That's why I asked Tozawa-Chan to pick you up!

00:07:37.540 --> 00:07:38.870
There you have it.

00:07:38.950 --> 00:07:41.960
Now, then! Let's drink, Masamune-Chan!

00:07:44.880 --> 00:07:50.710
I guess the section merger means
twice the work for you, if not more.

00:07:50.800 --> 00:07:54.470
I handled twice this amount
before I ever became director.

00:07:54.550 --> 00:07:58.010
So you worked hard to
make it here... Just wonderful!

00:07:58.100 --> 00:08:00.930
I've simply done what
anybody can but nobody does.

00:08:01.020 --> 00:08:04.690
You, too, could have this
view with enough hard work.

00:08:04.770 --> 00:08:06.770
I don't like hard work.

00:08:06.860 --> 00:08:09.980
Plus, if I made it this far up,

00:08:10.070 --> 00:08:12.860
I'd always worry about being pushed off.

00:08:13.860 --> 00:08:16.990
Are you suggesting I'll follow
in Takayama's footsteps?

00:08:17.070 --> 00:08:18.910
No, I just meant in general.

00:08:18.990 --> 00:08:22.040
Many people stand behind those in power,

00:08:22.120 --> 00:08:25.960
and those who've fallen
before come crawling back up.

00:08:26.040 --> 00:08:28.340
What are you so afraid of?

00:08:28.420 --> 00:08:32.010
Handling loads of work while
preparing for enemies all around...

00:08:32.090 --> 00:08:33.970
I could never do that.

00:08:34.050 --> 00:08:38.470
I'm impressed by your ability
to grasp power fearlessly!

00:08:38.550 --> 00:08:43.180
A person who grasps power must
always have that level of resolve.

00:08:45.900 --> 00:08:51.570
"Crawl back up"?
Don't tell me Takayama plans to

00:08:52.820 --> 00:08:54.900
Kyoko-san! How's Yuuki-Chan?

00:08:54.990 --> 00:08:59.570
Just great! She wants to see you!
You should come visit sometime!

00:08:59.660 --> 00:09:00.870
Yeah! I'd like that!

00:09:00.950 --> 00:09:03.450
I wanna have another group date!

00:09:03.540 --> 00:09:06.710
Yeah. Sometime soon...
Yahoo!

00:09:06.790 --> 00:09:11.630
Still, I'm curious why Chief Editor
Kyoko is out doing a story herself.

00:09:11.710 --> 00:09:13.420
Something big?

00:09:13.510 --> 00:09:16.510
The aftermath of something big.

00:09:16.590 --> 00:09:21.180
Takayama Reiji, the man who
resigned after the incident.

00:09:21.260 --> 00:09:24.930
A man at the very top comes
crashing down in one day.

00:09:25.020 --> 00:09:28.850
Wouldn't it be fascinating to
know what he was thinking then?

00:09:28.940 --> 00:09:30.980
That's why

00:09:31.070 --> 00:09:33.900
What is it? Is something wrong?

00:09:33.990 --> 00:09:37.320
No... So, Kyoko-san...

00:09:37.410 --> 00:09:38.950
Did you see Takayama?

00:09:39.030 --> 00:09:41.990
No. He seems to have
vacated the hotel he was living in.

00:09:42.080 --> 00:09:44.540
But I have a good idea where he is.

00:09:44.620 --> 00:09:48.080
And talking with people in the area
first is one way of getting a story.

00:09:48.170 --> 00:09:50.210
Are you going to write bad things?

00:09:50.290 --> 00:09:52.920
I don't know. I need to research first.

00:09:53.000 --> 00:09:55.340
The media has been pretty harsh on him,

00:09:55.420 --> 00:09:57.970
portraying him as a cold-hearted
man who only sees things as numbers.

00:09:58.050 --> 00:09:59.720
He's an elite who's never had setbacks,

00:09:59.800 --> 00:10:02.800
so his disappearance could be
because he decided to commit suicide...

00:10:02.890 --> 00:10:03.970
He wouldn't do that.

00:10:04.060 --> 00:10:06.180
Eh?

00:10:06.270 --> 00:10:11.940
He may be depressed, but
he's not the type to kill himself.

00:10:13.150 --> 00:10:16.990
Plus, he's not like other elitists
who've never had to suffer.

00:10:17.070 --> 00:10:20.990
His mother died when he
was little, so he feels alone.

00:10:21.070 --> 00:10:23.910
And he's more of a cheapskate
than a cold-hearted man,

00:10:23.990 --> 00:10:27.750
but he's actually surprisingly
nice when you get to
Hold on!

00:10:27.830 --> 00:10:30.370
You know him, Masane-san?!
Eh?

00:10:30.460 --> 00:10:33.540
And quite well, at that...
U-Uhh...

00:10:33.630 --> 00:10:36.130
Oh, so that's the deal...
Eh?

00:10:36.210 --> 00:10:38.970
Oh, your hunch was right, Missy.
How depressing...

00:10:39.050 --> 00:10:43.010
Of course I was right.
Eh? What? Hunch? I...

00:10:43.100 --> 00:10:46.470
Mom! You really do like Takayama-san after all!

00:10:46.560 --> 00:10:48.680
Hold on, Riko! What brought that on?!

00:10:48.770 --> 00:10:53.770
What a relief! I thought you
weren't worried about him at all!

00:10:53.860 --> 00:10:55.190
I'm not worried one bit!

00:10:55.270 --> 00:10:59.320
No, no, you spoke so
passionately about him. So sad...

00:10:59.400 --> 00:11:01.320
I see a pink aura...

00:11:01.410 --> 00:11:02.780
Quit making stuff up!

00:11:02.870 --> 00:11:04.870
What's going on?
Oh, uhh...

00:11:04.950 --> 00:11:08.540
Come on, Mom. You should quit
working for your new boss.

00:11:08.620 --> 00:11:10.790
Riko! Knock it off before I get mad!

00:11:10.870 --> 00:11:13.920
But Takayama-san is much better!
Is not!

00:11:14.000 --> 00:11:15.880
Is too!
Is not!

00:11:15.880 --> 00:11:18.920
You don't understand anything!
You don't understand, Mom!

00:11:19.010 --> 00:11:20.880
Quit telling me how to do my work!

00:11:20.970 --> 00:11:22.470
No!
Rihoko!

00:11:22.550 --> 00:11:23.890
Simmer down, now!

00:11:23.970 --> 00:11:26.810
Now, now. You too, Rihoko-Chan. Okay?

00:11:26.890 --> 00:11:28.930
You're so stupid, Mom!

00:11:29.020 --> 00:11:30.890
I don't like you!
Hey, now...

00:11:30.980 --> 00:11:34.730
Honestly! Talking to your mom
that way... I don't know you anymore!

00:11:34.810 --> 00:11:36.690
I don't know you anymore, either!

00:11:36.770 --> 00:11:39.940
Hey, hold on! You're not being mature here!

00:11:43.070 --> 00:11:44.030
Yeesh...

00:11:56.090 --> 00:11:57.210
Kyoko-san...

00:11:57.290 --> 00:11:58.920
Can I come in?

00:11:59.000 --> 00:12:02.720
I really embarrassed myself out there...

00:12:02.800 --> 00:12:05.140
Kids can be scary, huh?

00:12:05.220 --> 00:12:10.180
Especially girls. They're surprisingly
sensitive to parents' feelings.

00:12:10.270 --> 00:12:12.770
I don't like Takayama, I'm just...

00:12:12.850 --> 00:12:14.520
Concerned?
Eh?

00:12:14.600 --> 00:12:18.440
Like I said, I have a good idea where he is.

00:12:18.520 --> 00:12:20.190
No, I don't want

00:12:20.280 --> 00:12:22.150
Is it for Rihoko-Chan?
Eh?

00:12:22.240 --> 00:12:26.990
There was a time when I
worked really hard for my girl's sake.

00:12:27.070 --> 00:12:30.490
But that just turns into
a one-way street of love.

00:12:31.870 --> 00:12:34.410
Things didn't work out
between me and Yuuki.

00:12:37.630 --> 00:12:41.880
It's okay to listen to what children
want sometimes, don't you think?

00:12:45.970 --> 00:12:47.760
Riko?

00:12:49.720 --> 00:12:51.640
Say, Riko...

00:12:52.020 --> 00:12:56.140
I'd like to see Takayama-san...

00:12:56.230 --> 00:12:58.810
Is it okay if I go?

00:12:58.900 --> 00:13:01.780
Yeah! Of course, Mom!

00:13:01.860 --> 00:13:03.690
I might lose my job...

00:13:03.780 --> 00:13:08.030
That's all right! I can sell
boxed lunches if that happens!

00:13:08.120 --> 00:13:10.240
Riko...

00:13:10.330 --> 00:13:11.870
Thank you.

00:13:15.500 --> 00:13:18.330
Oh, brother. Guess I got no choice.

00:13:19.960 --> 00:13:22.960
C'mon. I'll give you a lift.

00:13:27.010 --> 00:13:29.800
I don't have an umbrella.
Oh, that's okay.

00:13:29.890 --> 00:13:30.800
Thanks!

00:13:30.890 --> 00:13:33.470
Just get going. You're gonna get soaked.

00:13:33.560 --> 00:13:36.060
Yeah! See you later!

00:13:45.030 --> 00:13:49.700
Umm... Hello...

00:13:49.780 --> 00:13:52.370
What do you want at this hour?

00:13:52.450 --> 00:13:56.080
Don't talk like that! I came
here because I was worried!

00:13:56.160 --> 00:14:00.790
I must've really fallen far
to have you worried about me.

00:14:00.880 --> 00:14:02.920
Come in.

00:14:03.000 --> 00:14:05.050
He's so not cute.

00:14:08.510 --> 00:14:11.010
Even people like you can get upset...

00:14:11.100 --> 00:14:13.930
I'd be lying if I said I wasn't hurting.

00:14:14.010 --> 00:14:17.270
It seems I loved the company that much.

00:14:17.350 --> 00:14:21.690
And you protected that
company, right? That's good, then!

00:14:21.770 --> 00:14:24.320
Why not make a clean start
and go into another business?

00:14:24.400 --> 00:14:28.490
Besides, you'll only go bald if you
just sit in a room giving orders.

00:14:28.570 --> 00:14:31.570
And to be honest,
you're not the suit kind of guy.

00:14:31.660 --> 00:14:33.870
Is that supposed to make me feel better?

00:14:33.950 --> 00:14:35.580
Did it cheer you up any?

00:14:35.660 --> 00:14:37.910
No! Now quit talking!

00:14:38.000 --> 00:14:41.290
What?! I'm trying to help you here!

00:14:41.380 --> 00:14:42.880
I said quit talking!

00:14:42.960 --> 00:14:45.670
Oh, I see! Alright, then! I'm leaving!

00:14:45.750 --> 00:14:48.590
It's pouring, you know.
Mind your own business!

00:14:51.220 --> 00:14:53.430
That baldy!

00:14:55.470 --> 00:14:56.890
What?!

00:14:57.980 --> 00:15:00.850
Hey, let go! I'm going home!

00:15:02.310 --> 00:15:03.810
Bye!

00:15:19.080 --> 00:15:23.040
What was that? This wasn't why I

00:15:32.010 --> 00:15:33.640
Yagi.

00:15:33.720 --> 00:15:38.060
I'd like to turn you back to normal,
but there's an obstacle in my way.

00:15:38.140 --> 00:15:40.180
As long as it exists, you'll be

00:15:40.270 --> 00:15:44.270
Taka... yama... Taka... yama...

00:15:44.360 --> 00:15:47.900
Yes! You catch on fast, Yagi!

00:15:49.360 --> 00:15:51.110
I'm back.

00:15:54.030 --> 00:15:56.570
It's on the house today.
Huh?

00:15:57.530 --> 00:16:00.830
Heartbreak and alcohol go hand-in-hand, right?

00:16:05.830 --> 00:16:08.540
Where's your daughter?

00:16:08.630 --> 00:16:12.130
Riko? The people in our building
are watching her for me.

00:16:12.220 --> 00:16:13.970
I see.

00:16:14.050 --> 00:16:18.550
Say... Rihoko is your child, right?

00:16:18.640 --> 00:16:20.470
Yeah...

00:16:23.770 --> 00:16:26.310
Then you should tell her...
No.

00:16:26.400 --> 00:16:28.270
Eh?

00:16:28.360 --> 00:16:30.400
I don't know how to interact with her.

00:16:30.480 --> 00:16:35.780
To be honest, it doesn't
feel like she's my child.

00:16:35.860 --> 00:16:39.200
I make a pathetic father, don't I?

00:16:41.370 --> 00:16:44.830
I was the same way, you know.

00:16:44.920 --> 00:16:48.840
I'm sure it'll change once you
actually meet and talk with her.

00:16:50.880 --> 00:16:51.880
Look out!

00:17:01.060 --> 00:17:02.310
Hey! You all right?!

00:17:02.390 --> 00:17:04.350
Masane!
I'm going!

00:17:08.400 --> 00:17:11.940
You... Quit getting in the way!

00:17:13.570 --> 00:17:20.120
L-Let me kill Director Takayama
with my own two hands...

00:17:21.660 --> 00:17:23.950
Why not have a go at me first?

00:17:24.040 --> 00:17:27.000
That... sounds good, too!

00:17:42.010 --> 00:17:43.140
Masane!

00:17:49.440 --> 00:17:50.860
Damn!

00:17:54.030 --> 00:17:57.400
No! I'm going to be killed!

00:17:57.490 --> 00:18:03.700
I need more... More power!

00:18:26.850 --> 00:18:28.680
Don't worry...

00:18:28.770 --> 00:18:30.810
It'll be over soon!

00:19:02.260 --> 00:19:04.220
Masane!

00:19:04.300 --> 00:19:05.930
Are you...

00:19:07.390 --> 00:19:11.940
I'm fine. It was nothing.

00:19:14.060 --> 00:19:16.860
So things went well, then?

00:19:16.940 --> 00:19:20.530
A new Sister will be born
in several months' time.

00:19:21.990 --> 00:19:23.160
Maria...

00:19:23.240 --> 00:19:24.160
Oh!

00:19:24.240 --> 00:19:28.740
Nothing makes me happier
than seeing that you've grown!

00:19:28.830 --> 00:19:32.920
Now then, let me give you
another one of your rewards.

00:19:33.000 --> 00:19:35.040
Anything you'd like at all...

00:19:35.130 --> 00:19:37.040
There is one thing.

00:19:37.130 --> 00:19:39.130
What is it?

00:19:42.130 --> 00:19:44.340
Power...

00:19:57.070 --> 00:19:58.360
Maria...

00:19:58.440 --> 00:20:05.410
Grandfather, I will obtain everything.
Everything that I want...

00:20:11.830 --> 00:20:13.460
Maria...

00:20:13.540 --> 00:20:16.540
You truly are marvelous...

00:20:16.630 --> 00:20:21.760
There's no question about it...
The next Sister born will be perfect...

00:20:21.840 --> 00:20:26.890
Father, those aren't your
genes in those capsules.

00:20:26.970 --> 00:20:28.350
We can't go on like this.

00:20:28.430 --> 00:20:32.140
No further progress will be made
if we continue to use your genes.

00:20:32.230 --> 00:20:39.440
They aren't... my genes? They're... not mine?!

00:20:42.530 --> 00:20:45.070
Absurd! What for?!

00:20:45.160 --> 00:20:47.950
I am going to be born again!

00:20:48.030 --> 00:20:55.460
From the perfect mother!
My true self must be born! It must!

00:20:55.540 --> 00:20:57.750
No!

00:20:57.830 --> 00:21:02.050
Redo it! With... my... genes...

00:21:03.970 --> 00:21:07.930
I'm... I'm...

00:21:08.010 --> 00:21:10.930
Mother!

00:21:11.010 --> 00:21:14.270
You're acting shamelessly.

00:21:14.350 --> 00:21:15.810
Aoi, let's go.

00:21:15.890 --> 00:21:17.230
Yes.

00:21:19.190 --> 00:21:20.940
Chief Nishida.

00:21:21.020 --> 00:21:24.740
I believe you can still be of use.

00:21:29.370 --> 00:21:33.950
What... what ferociousness...

00:21:34.040 --> 00:21:35.830
You're complete now...

00:21:38.880 --> 00:21:40.960
Maria...

00:21:46.790 --> 00:21:54.740
I turn around half-asleep as my hits the right side of my cheek

00:21:54.740 --> 00:22:02.990
Your voice was there, and the air was warm

00:22:02.990 --> 00:22:11.260
Your right hand grazes my left shoulder

00:22:11.260 --> 00:22:15.730
But why don't you hold on tight?

00:22:20.340 --> 00:22:28.500
In order to change yesterday's wish tomorrow,

00:22:28.500 --> 00:22:35.690
I need to grow stronger myself

00:22:36.920 --> 00:22:44.840
Even now, I am breathing in your scent, ...

00:22:44.840 --> 00:22:53.510
and jumping over to your side. Give me your love.

00:22:55.180 --> 00:23:02.990
Extend your hands. Reach them out to me.

00:23:02.990 --> 00:23:09.540
I'm so happy

00:23:12.180 --> 00:23:17.640
Riko! Want to go out on a date?
It'd be with Takayama-san!

00:23:17.720 --> 00:23:20.940
You said before that you really liked him,

00:23:21.020 --> 00:23:24.520
and he says he wants to be friends with you!

00:23:24.610 --> 00:23:27.900
I'm sure he'll take you wherever you want!

00:23:27.980 --> 00:23:30.780
If you want anything,
just sweet-talk it out of him!

00:23:30.860 --> 00:23:34.990
Don't think of him as my boss!
Let him spoil you lots!

00:23:35.080 --> 00:23:40.000
I think you'll both like each other a lot!
